				<r3d:description language="eng">The Royal Library of the Netherlands (Dutch: Koninklijke Bibliotheek or KB; Royal Library) is the national library of the Netherlands. The KB collects everything that is published in and concerning the Netherlands, from medieval literature to today&#039;s publications. The e-Depot contains
